# ERASING lives in the EDIT LIST now (TRACKS, EDIT; white 12 ERASE NOTES, 13 ERASE AUTO, 14 ERASE ALL PARTS): the first press asks,
# the second (within 3 s) does it, each one undo step. No timed REC hold erases any more. PLAY on ROAD from the chosen block; the
# block chosen picks the part.
wait 300
demo
wait 100
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
wait 50
mark
listen
# REC held 3 s with nothing else: nothing is erased, and no take starts on letting go
press REC
wait 3000
release REC
wait 50
expect events >0
expect recording 0
expect counting 0
page 11
tap EDIT
wait 100
expect layview 1
shot p40_edit_erase.png
tapkey w11
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
expect events >0
shot p41_edit_erase_ask.png
tapkey w11
wait 100
said NOTES ERASED
expect events 0
expect eventsB1 >0
press EDIT
wait 800
release EDIT
wait 50
expect same 1
# ALL PARTS: this track in all 8 parts, notes and automation; one undo step
tapkey w13
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
tapkey w13
wait 100
said ALL ERASED
expect events 0
expect eventsB1 0
expect eventsC1 0
press EDIT
wait 800
release EDIT
wait 50
expect same 1
expect eventsB1 >0
# another item between the asks forgets the ask
tapkey w11
wait 100
tapkey w0
wait 100
tapkey w11
wait 100
said AGAIN = ERASE
expect events >0
tap EDIT
wait 50
expect layview 0
# a tap is still a recording
tap REC
wait 100
expect counting >0
tap REC
wait 100
# ROAD: the third block chosen, PLAY in SONG plays from it
tap ENV
wait 50
turn K1 2
wait 50
expect part 2
turn K4 1
wait 50
expect playmode 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect part 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect textfit 0
